{
    "title": "Match and Meet - Dating app",
    "description": "Match & Meet is a unique dating application where you can chat with like-minded people in a special chat that instantly translates messages into your native language.\r\n\r\nTake a short psychological test and find out your best match. Find attractive people close to you who share the same interests, and get to know them before meeting in real life. Our free dating app will help you communicate without boundaries and find the right match online. Join thousands of single people looking for a real relationship. \r\n\r\n3 Reasons to download the Match & Meet app:\r\n\r\n1. Meet interesting users nearby\r\n2. Explore people according to interests before dating online\r\n3. Find the right match for yourself\r\n\r\nWhat else can you do with Match & Meet?\r\n\r\n1. View photos, browse through photo albums\r\n2. Like and comment on the best photos\r\n3. Add the most interesting profiles to your favorites\r\n4. Translate messages into your native language and understand all chats\r\n5. Reply to all messages in a polite and friendly way\r\n\r\nLooking to make new friends in your city?\r\n\r\nFind new friends in your city to chat online, meet in person, and have a great time! Match & Meet  is available in the most cosmopolitan cities around the world, with a large community of singles looking for a date or relationship.\r\n\r\nHow to use the Match & Meet app?\r\n\r\n- Just download the Match & Meet app on your mobile phone or tablet\r\n- Start chatting in real-time right now\r\n\r\nWelcome to Match & Meet! A fascinating world of real live communication!\r\n\r\nDiscover a new form of online dating without any language barriers. Match & Meet will help you find the best matches according to your location, interests, and preferences. Start meaningful relationships with nearby people and chat before meeting. \r\n\r\nMatch & Meet is an innovative dating app that allows you to meet new people without any limits! Explore your matches anywhere in the world, and communicate in any language.\r\n\r\nOnline dating made simple.\r\n\r\nConnect with relevant users who share the same interests as you, understand them in any language, and enjoy chat with your matches. Match & Meet provides a unique way to get to know fellow singles. Start chatting with people who share the same interests and locations as you!\r\n\r\nUser protection\r\n\r\nWe strictly prohibit all forms of profanity, nudity, and obscenity. Match & Meet users can report bad behavior at any time by contacting us at support@corp.loka.world.\r\n\r\nMatch & Meet is free to download. If you want to get the most from the app, you can subscribe to our optional subscription product They Stream Premium (monthly - $14.99,  3-monthly - $29.99, 6-monthly - $49.99, 12-monthly - $69.99). The prices may vary per country and are subject to change without notice.\r\n\r\n* if you choose to use our free trial, any unused portion of the free trial period will be forfeited when you purchase a subscription to that publication\r\n\r\nYour personal data is stored securely in Match & Meet - be sure to read our privacy policy and terms:\r\n\r\nhttps://loka.world/policy/\r\nhttps://loka.world/terms/",
